HAI 1.2
CAN HAS STDIO?
BTW ============================================================================
BTW GUDGEON MARITIME AUTONOMY :: IMO MSC/CIRC.1053 CRASH STOP TRIAL
BTW Astern full power stopping distance and head reach qualification
BTW ============================================================================

I HAS A VESSEL_LENGTH_M ITZ 24.0
I HAS A MAX_HEAD_REACH_LIMIT_LENGTHS ITZ 15.0

HOW IZ I COMPUTE_MAX_ALLOWABLE_HEAD_REACH_M
    FOUND YR PRODUKT OF VESSEL_LENGTH_M AN MAX_HEAD_REACH_LIMIT_LENGTHS
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I EVALUATE_CRASH_STOP_PASS YR MEASURED_HEAD_REACH_M AN YR STOP_TIME_SEC
    I HAS A MAX_REACH ITZ I IZ COMPUTE_MAX_ALLOWABLE_HEAD_REACH_M MKAY
    I HAS A REACH_OK ITZ BOTH SAEM SMALLR OF MEASURED_HEAD_REACH_M AN MAX_REACH AN MEASURED_HEAD_REACH_M
    I HAS A TIME_OK ITZ BOTH SAEM SMALLR OF STOP_TIME_SEC AN 60.0 AN STOP_TIME_SEC
    FOUND YR BOTH OF REACH_OK AN TIME_OK
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I TEST_CRASH_STOP_QUALIFICATION_01
    I HAS A REACH ITZ 156.0
    I HAS A T_SEC ITZ 28.4
    I HAS A PASSED ITZ I IZ EVALUATE_CRASH_STOP_PASS YR REACH AN YR T_SEC MKAY
    FOUND YR PASSED
IF U SAY SO

